  "title": "HB2244 (2025-2026 Regular Session): In sales and use tax, further providing for exclusions from tax. Amending Title 18 (Crimes and Offenses) of the Pennsylvania Consolidated Statutes, in firearms and other dangerous articles, providing for the offense of unauthorized access to firearms.",
  "urls": [
    "https://www.palegis.us/legislation/bills/2025/hb2244",
    "https://www.palegis.us/legislation/bills/text/PDF/2025/0/HB2244/PN3505",
